The two binding EJR lower bounds are the 6-voter ℓ=3 requirement on {x1,x2,x3} and the 4-voter ℓ=2 requirement on {y4,y5,y6}. The first is met once any two x-candidates are seated (with voter 1 personally closing the quota via y1 or z3); the second is met by any two members of {y4,y5,y6,z1,z2}.  

